          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Era mperaano, nze Nebukadinezzari nsaaka Katonda ow'eigulu, naamugulumiza era naamutaamu ekitiisa kuba by'akola byonabyona bituufu era tasaliriza nsonga. Abo abeetwala okuba aba ghaigulu abaisa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.37",
